                        "language": "english",
                        "review": ".....plz don't buy this. This feels like a flash game. I wish I didn't spend what I spent to play this. I can understand the idea behind this sounds like it'd be fun, and the video looks somewhat legit, but it's not what you're expecting. I couldn't get sound at all, everytime I try to start it for some reason steamvr boots up, it's just in general a big glitchy mess. It plays nothing like the gameplay video shows. Save yourself $5 and go play H1Z1 Auto Royale, it's free and lightyears better than this waste.",
